{"id":"n81715-1-8","stage":4,"title":"칼럼 · 专栏","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81715-1-8-1","ko":"뭘 그렇게 열심히 읽고 있어?","zh":"你在那么认真地读什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地。","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"읽고","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽고","audio":"/audio/9a50865063fb154ddc7d.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/66c581a26583e0f5f363.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81715-1-8-2","ko":"잡지에 나온 칼럼이 재미있어서 좀 읽고 있었어.","zh":"杂志上的专栏很有趣，所以我就读了一会儿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잡지에","meaning":"杂志","explanation":"잡지：杂志；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"잡지","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62518","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡지에","audio":"/audio/d7fbeb657fe9efe2a398.mp3"}},{"text":"나온","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나온","audio":"/audio/a357a1f232b9a828c908.mp3"}},{"text":"칼럼이","meaning":"专栏，专栏评论","explanation":"칼럼：专栏，专栏评论；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"칼럼","audio":"/audio/97f22e7aa8590436c263.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81715","senseId":"1","lemma":"칼럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"칼럼이","audio":"/audio/0dd7e895818e56820b42.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있어서","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있어서","audio":"/audio/28f4655025df46cff812.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"좀：一会儿。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"2","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"읽고","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽고","audio":"/audio/9a50865063fb154ddc7d.mp3"}},{"text":"있었어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었어","audio":"/audio/7f1221d9d5431e3ca85b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6064de0a4717871","term":"잡지","zh":"杂志","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3","entryId":"62518","definition":"定期发行的书，有各种内容的新闻、照片、广告等。","pronunciation":["잡찌"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在书籍、报纸、广播电视等上登载文章、画作或出现某种内容。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"97f22e7aa8590436","term":"칼럼","zh":"专栏，专栏评论","audio":"/audio/97f22e7aa8590436c263.mp3","entryId":"81715","definition":"在报纸、杂志等上，对某一个主题做简短评述的文章。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一会儿","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","defi